'''ZL 38''' (ダンシング解放区 ''Danshingu Kaihōku'', '''Dancing Liberation Zone''') is the 38th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 136th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
?

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[E-792]]: A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that acts as a weaker version of [[The Perfect Cyclone]] with lower standing range, effective range and damage, but weakens units to 25% for 2 seconds, effectively perma-weakening them with her non-stop attacks.
*[[Sathankhamun VIII]]: An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Hannya]] from the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Rashomon]]. Only stands at 650 range, but has Omni Strikes that reach up to 800 and slows units for 2 seconds.

